OL,3,GNEWSAAddiction recovery walk to bring
OL,4,Athousands to city
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The consultant finally said to me, 'If
OL,7,Fyou're carrying on drinking you might
OL,8,Fas well just dispense with the
OL,9,Fmedication you're taking for the
OL,10,Fepilepsy because they just cancel each
OL,11,Fother out.'
